WEBVTT

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:30.961
AG: As surgeon general,
Vivek started looking into the data

00:04:30.985 --> 00:04:32.969
on the health implications of loneliness.

00:04:32.993 --> 00:04:36.946
VM: If I were to tell you that the impact
of loneliness on our lifespan

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:40.346
is equivalent to that of smoking
15 cigarettes a day,

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:41.576
it might surprise you.

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:43.145
AG: OK, so wait a minute, Vivek.

00:04:43.169 --> 00:04:45.416
Are you telling me that I'm better off

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:48.826
smoking 15 cigarettes a day
with a bunch of friends

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:52.337
than quitting smoking and being lonely?

00:04:52.361 --> 00:04:53.676
(Vivek laughs)

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:57.339
VM: Well, I certainly wouldn't
endorse smoking in any context,

00:04:57.363 --> 00:05:00.984
but the key point here, though,
is that we should think about loneliness